title: date_kuzan_2_main
location: night(bedroom)
---
<<declare $kd2_points = 0>>
You are awake when you should be sleeping. Why?
-> Too much coffee before bed
    Ugh, you're all jittery and can't get comfortable.
-> Can't stop thinking about embarrassing moments from your past
    That one time you said butthole instead of porthole in front of Vice Admiral Cancer will never leave you be.
-> The bed sucks
    Why are all Navy issue beds just the worst?!
Do you continue trying to sleep or give up and go for a walk?
-> Yes, anything but the tossing and turning
    You sigh and roll out of bed, putting on a coat and shoes before heading out.
    <<jump date_kuzan_2_GetUp>>
-> No. You must beat your brain into submission
    <<jump date_kuzan_2_OPIkea>>
===

title: date_kuzan_2_GetUp
location: night(town)
---
The streets are quieter and emptier than during the day, but this is a place that always has some activity. Still, you find the docks to be empty with just the sound of the water. The stars stretch out high above you, the ocean waves flowing in and bumping against the pier. How pret—!
!!You trip over something!! #shake

You just barely keep your footing, hearing a grunt from below as you steady yourself. You look down at your feet.
<<jump date_kuzan_2_GetUp2>>
===

title: date_kuzan_2_GetUp2
characters: [kuzan]
---
Vice Admiral Kuzan lifts his sleeping mask to stare at you blearily.
-> Oh no! I'm sorry sir, I didn't see you there!
    <<set $kd2_points += 2>>
    {$kuzan}: Oh {$name}, what are you doing here?
-> Watch where you're sleeping, I nearly broke my neck!
    <<set $kd2_points -= 1>>
    {$kuzan}: Arara, you're the one who stepped on me.
    {$kuzan}: Anyway, what are you doing here?
-> Uh... good evening...?
    <<set $kd2_points += 1>>
    {$kuzan}: It was, until you stepped on me. I was having a nice dream, too...
    {$kuzan}: Anyway, what are you doing here?
-> Phew, I'm glad you're not a giant seagull! <<if visited("date_kuzan_2_OPIkea")>>
    {$kuzan}: Uh... me too I guess?
    {$kuzan}: ... Anyway, what are you doing here?

{$name}:
-> Couldn't sleep. <<if !visited("date_kuzan_2_OPIkea")>>
    {$kuzan}: Ah. Yeah. Same boat. Watching the waves helps. Here, take a seat.
    -> Oh, thanks.
        <<jump date_kuzan_2_SitAndChat>>
    -> Nah, I'm good, see ya around.
        <<jump date_kuzan_2_End>>
-> I was fleeing from my nightmares. <<if visited("date_kuzan_2_OPIkea")>>
    {$kuzan}: Ah. Yeah. Same boat. Watching the waves helps. Here, take a seat.
    -> Oh, thanks.
        <<jump date_kuzan_2_SitAndChat>>
    -> Nah, I'm good, see ya around.
        <<jump date_kuzan_2_End>>
-> Walking around, looking for my missing sleep.
    {$kuzan}: *laughs* Alright, want some company?
    -> Oh, uh, sure.
        <<jump date_kuzan_2_WalkKaraoke>>
    -> Nah, I'm good, see ya around.
        <<jump date_kuzan_2_End>>
===

title: date_kuzan_2_SitAndChat
---
You sit down next to the Admiral, looking out at the waves. A few lonely street lights reflect off the water, and farther out, stars. A wisp of cloud drifts over the moon. It's soothing in its infinity, though it leaves you feeling... some kind of way.
{$kuzan}: Nice, huh?
-> Yeah, makes me feel small
    {$kuzan}: Me too, that's what I like about it. But in your case, I'd be worried about you getting much smaller.
    {$name}:
        -> Hey, size isn't what matters!
            {$kuzan}: Hm, that's what they all say.
            {$name}: ...
            {$kuzan}: ...
            {$name}: Walked into that one huh?
            {$kuzan}: It's because I'm so big, hard to miss.
            {$name}:
                -> You are pretty tall.
                    {$kuzan}: -smile- Emphasis on the pretty or the tall?
                    {$name}: ... So how about that ocean, huh?!
                    {$kuzan}: -laugh- Nice dodge. Thanks for the laugh, it's been a while.
                    {$name}: I'm here all night! So... what are you doing out here, really?
                    {$kuzan}: Thinking. How are you doing anyway, the job treating you okay? Wouldn't want to be in your shoes, trying to get us not to kill each other.
                    <<jump date_kuzan_2_HowJob>>
                -> Eh, I've seen bigger.
                    {$kuzan}: What are we talking about now? Or who?
                    {$name}: The size of the ocean, obviously.
                    {$kuzan}: -laugh- Obviously. Thanks for the laugh, I needed that.
                    {$name}: I'm here all night! So... what are you doing out here, really?
                    {$kuzan}: Thinking. How are you doing anyway, the job treating you okay? Wouldn't want to be in your shoes, trying to get us not to kill each other.
                    <<jump date_kuzan_2_HowJob>>
                -> SO ANYWAY, look at that ocean. Sure is, uh... wet, huh?
                    {$kuzan}: -laugh- Thanks, I needed that.
                    {$name}: I'm here all night! So... what are you doing out here, really?
                    {$kuzan}: Thinking. How are you doing anyway, the job treating you okay? Wouldn't want to be in your shoes, trying to get us not to kill each other.
                    <<jump date_kuzan_2_HowJob>>
        -> Oh a funny guy huh? Wanna hear a joke?
            <<set $kd2_points += 1>>
            {$kuzan}: Alright, what?
            {$name}: You.
            {$kuzan}: ...Ouch. You bite huh?
            {$name}: You bit first!
            {$kuzan}: -laugh- Man it's been a while since I had someone rib me. Thanks, I needed that.
            {$name}: I'm here all night! So...what are you doing out here, really?
            {$kuzan}: Thinking. How are you doing anyway, the job treating you okay? Wouldn't want to be in your shoes, trying to get us not to kill each other.
            <<jump date_kuzan_2_HowJob>>
        -> I also like how it makes me remember that there is more than just...my everyday routine out there.
            <<set $kd2_points += 2>>
            {$kuzan}: Ah yeah. How are you doing, the job treating you okay? Wouldn't want to be in your shoes, trying to get us not to kill each other.
            <<jump date_kuzan_2_HowJob>>

-> Feel like HQ is lacking a pier with a ferris wheel
    {$kuzan}: Tourists at HQ? -grimace- Eh...
    {$name}: Could be nice! Music, dancing, popcorn!
    {$kuzan}: That's what Saobaody is for.
    {$name}: Okay, that's... true. So anyway... what are you doing out here, really?
    {$kuzan}: Thinking. How are you doing anyway, the job treating you okay? Wouldn't want to be in your shoes, trying to get us to not kill each other.
    <<jump date_kuzan_2_HowJob>>

-> As long as a kaiju sized sea king doesn't suddenly emerge, yeah, it's nice
    {$kuzan}: Arara... be pretty bold of it with me here.
    {$name}: Yeah, that's true. You could just freeze it and make it a giant sculpture, huh?
    {$kuzan}: Yeah, done that before.
    {$name}: Whoa, really?!
    {$kuzan}: Yep. -He looks unhappy for a moment.-
    {$name}: So... what are you doing out here, really?
    {$kuzan}: Thinking. How are you doing anyway, the job treating you okay? Wouldn't want to be in your shoes, trying to get us to not kill each other.
    <<jump date_kuzan_2_HowJob>>
===

title: date_kuzan_2_HowJob
---
-> It's great!
    <<set $kd2_points -= 1>>
    <<jump date_kuzan_2_Great>>
-> It's... not without its ups and downs.
    <<set $kd2_points += 2>>
    <<jump date_kuzan_2_EH>>
-> It could be better.
    <<set $kd2_points += 1>>
    <<jump date_kuzan_2_Bad>>
===

title: date_kuzan_2_Great
---
{$kuzan}: Really? Weird.
{$name}: Uh... what's that supposed to mean?
{$kuzan}: Just expected you to be... what's the word, uh...
{$name}: Struggling, flailing, miserable?
{$kuzan}: Ah yeah, that first one. Though you're the one who said miserable, not me.
{$name}: Well I'm not. Though you and the Fleet Admiral don't always make it easy, but I'm up to the challenge!
{$kuzan}: ...
{$kuzan}: That makes one of us.
The two of you drift off into silence, a difficult expression on Kuzan's face. A breeze blows across your shoulders, the Admiral continuing to stare moodily at the horizon. It takes you a moment to notice that he's doing something with his gloved hand. You squint. Is that... is that a flower made of ice?
<<jump date_kuzan_2_Flower>>
===

title: date_kuzan_2_EH
---
