-> Which idiot?
    {$kuzan}: -laugh- Fair. Though Issho might be a little smarter than the rest of us. But it's Sakazuki. That bastard.
    {$name}: Be nice.
    {$kuzan}: No. Those days are long past...
    The two of you drift off into silence, a difficult expression on Kuzan's face. A breeze blows across your shoulders, the Admiral continuing to stare moodily at the horizon. It takes you a moment to notice that he's doing something with his gloved hand. You squint. Is that... is that a flower made of ice?
    // <<jump  TODO: Fix jump target

-> Well... yeah. The Fleet Admiral can be very strict, I see why you clash so much.
    {$kuzan}: Tch. Stupid bastard.
    {$name}: Be nice.
    {$kuzan}: No. Those days are long past...
    The two of you drift off into silence, a difficult expression on Kuzan's face. A breeze blows across your shoulders, the Admiral continuing to stare moodily at the horizon. It takes you a moment to notice that he's doing something with his gloved hand. You squint. Is that...is that a flower made of ice?
<<jump date_kuzan_2_Flower>>
===

title: date_kuzan_2_Flower
---
-> Oh, that's pretty.
    {$kuzan}: Thanks. You want it?
        -> Yes
        <<set $kd2_points += 2>>
            He hands you the flower. It's cold as expected, but the petals are so delicate looking! It appears to be some kind of chrysanthemum.
            {$name}: Wow! What else can you make? GO TO 2eii1
        -> No
        <<set $kd2_points -= 1>>
            He tosses the flower into the ocean, leaning back on his hands. It doesn't seem to have made him feel better.
            {$name}: So... uh, what else can you make? GO TO 2eii1
-> What other stuff can you make?
    {$kuzan}: What do you want?
        -> A bear
            {$kuzan}: A bear?
            {$name}: Yeah!
            {$kuzan}: ...Okay then.
            With a flourish, ice sprouts from his hands into the shape of a huge bear. Well. More like the rounded body of a real bear but the head of a teddy bear. You can't decide if it's cute or creepy.
            {$name}: Well, it's a bear.
            {$kuzan}: Yep. LOOP to ii2
        -> Ice brass knuckles
            {$kuzan}: That sounds dumb, but guess I offered. -He takes less than a second to make them. You put them on. They are freezing and look cool for about 3 seconds before you have to take them off because duh, ice. -
            {$name}: Yeah, that was dumb. Can I try again? LOOP to ii2
        -> Go big or go home, an ice rink!
            {$kuzan}: Arara, back up then.
            You do as he says and watch, mouth a little open as he steps forward, pressing his hand to the ground. Ice blooms outward, glimmering in the light. In just a few moments, there's a small, but proper circular ice rink.
            {$kuzan}: Alright, there.
            <<jump date_kuzan_2_Skate>>
        -> IF OP_IKEA: A seagull
            {$kuzan}: A seagull? Don't you see those everyday?
            {$name}: Can you make it or not?
            {$kuzan}: Yeah yeah.
            Ice erupts from his hands, forming wings and a pointed beak. It's actually pretty well done.
            -> Smash it
                {$kuzan}: ...?
                {$name}: That's for chasing me.
                {$kuzan}: You got chased by seagulls?
                {$name}: No just... in my dream, a really big seagull attacked me in a store.
                {$kuzan}: -laugh- Your nightmare was a giant seagull, huh? Symbolism much?
                {$name}: Huh?
                {$kuzan}: The symbol of the Navy. A seagull.
                {$name}: Oh. Not sure I've thought about it that way...
                {$kuzan}: ...Wouldn't blame you if you did.
                {$name}: ...So what else can you make? LOOP to ii2
            -> Set it into the water and salute it as it slowly sets out to sea
                {$kuzan}: Brave soldier taking flight.
                {$name}: May he find a place to roost.
                {$kuzan}: This a uh... a thing?
                {$name}: What?
                {$kuzan}: A... meta? Meta-thing?
                {$name}:...Metaphor?
                {$kuzan}: That.
                {$name}: I'm not sure. I just hope it means I won't dream of a seagull coming after me again.
                {$kuzan}: Hm. Yeah. Me too.
                {$name}: You give him a quizzical look and raise an eyebrow. He looks far away again.
                {$name}: So... what else can you make? LOOP to ii2
===

title: date_kuzan_2_Bad
---
{$kuzan}: Yeah... sorry about him.
{$name}: ...Wait who?
{$kuzan}: Sakazuki. -Grimace-
    -> Oh. Yeah he's um... a bit... (++)
    <<set $kd2_points += 2>>
        <<jump date_kuzan_2_EH>>
