        The two of you drift off into silence, a difficult expression on Kuzan's face. A breeze blows across your shoulders, the Admiral continuing to stare moodily at the horizon. It takes you a moment to notice that he's doing something with his gloved hand. You squint. Is that... is that a flower made of ice?
        {$kuzan}: Well. I should go find somewhere else to sleep. I'll see you around, {$name}. -He leaves the flower behind him on the sand.- DATE END
    -> You're all a pain in the ass. (+)
    <<set $kd2_points += 1>>
